{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a medieval village where betrayal hides behind every smile\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This online multiplayer game pits up to 12 players against each other in a battle of trust, strategy, and survival. Among the noble knights, impostors lurk\u2014able to shapeshift into terrifying creatures like the <strong>Banshee</strong>, <strong>Basilisk</strong>, or <strong>Werewolf</strong> to hunt their prey under the cover of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfolds in real time, driven by a dynamic <strong>day/night cycle</strong>. Work together to complete quests, gather clues, and find scattered weapons\u2014but be careful who you trust. Not everyone has noble intentions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 3 to 12 players online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 1 to 3 impostors with monstrous transformations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Real-time day/night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Quests, skills, and randomized weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Tense, paranoid atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Online multiplayer only</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust no one. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748390?t=1770371731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748390/c143750c3d364aef473ee2acd78efcd691579ec4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770371731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748390/b0d44f4968372db6312ee1b17ca9dea5925213e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770371731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748390/b0d44f4968372db6312ee1b17ca9dea5925213e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770371731","categ